# {{ .vars.service_name }} API Documentation

## Base URL

- Development: `http://localhost:8080/api/v1`
- Production: `https://api.{{ .vars.domain | default "example.com" }}/v1`

## Authentication

All endpoints (except `/health`) require a valid JWT token.

```
Authorization: Bearer <token>
```

## Endpoints

### Health Check

```
GET /health
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "healthy",
  "version": "1.0.0"
}
```

### List Resources

```
GET /api/v1/resources
```

**Query Parameters:**
- `page_size` (int): Number of items per page (default: 20)
- `page_token` (string): Pagination token

**Response:**
```json
{
  "items": [...],
  "next_page_token": "abc123",
  "total_count": 100
}
```

### Create Resource

```
POST /api/v1/resources
```

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "name": "resource-name",
  "metadata": {
    "key": "value"
  }
}
```

**Response:** `201 Created`
```json
{
  "id": "uuid",
  "name": "resource-name",
  "metadata": {...},
  "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "updated_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}
```

### Get Resource

```
GET /api/v1/resources/{id}
```

**Response:** `200 OK`

### Update Resource

```
PUT /api/v1/resources/{id}
```

**Response:** `200 OK`

### Delete Resource

```
DELETE /api/v1/resources/{id}
```

**Response:** `204 No Content`

## Error Responses

```json
{
  "error": "error message"
}
```

| Status | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| 400 | Bad Request |
| 401 | Unauthorized |
| 404 | Not Found |
| 429 | Too Many Requests |
| 500 | Internal Server Error |
